  m_text: "Press Alt Fire to <color=#FF4343>pump</color> your shotgun, increasing the <color=#FF4343>power</color> and decreasing the <color=#FF4343>accuracy</color> of your <color=#FF4343>next shot</color>.\n\nToo many pumps will cause an <color=#FF4343>explosion</color> when fired."
